1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,508
Bell: Roof door sealed. We made it.
Almost.

2
00:00:03,828 --> 00:00:08,562
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Attention, residents. This is The
Last Floor. Part two of two: the roof.

3
00:00:08,882 --> 00:00:11,860
Omar: Twelve floors. My legs filed a
complaint.

4
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:12,914
Zara: Now what?

5
00:00:13,034 --> 00:00:15,783
Bell: Now we signal. Three of anything.

6
00:00:16,103 --> 00:00:19,466
Bell: Three flashes. Pause. Repeat.

7
00:00:19,786 --> 00:00:21,138
Omar: My pan is a mirror.

8
00:00:21,258 --> 00:00:22,545
Zara: Your pan is a plan?!

9
00:00:22,865 --> 00:00:25,459
Bell: Rule two. Signal in threes.

10
00:00:25,779 --> 00:00:28,736
Bell: The fire door. It's holding. Please
keep holding.

11
00:00:29,056 --> 00:00:30,873
Pip: Mayday! Mayday! Open the door!

12
00:00:31,193 --> 00:00:32,746
Omar: I taught him that. Yesterday.

13
00:00:33,066 --> 00:00:34,739
Zara: Look. Lights in the sky.

14
00:00:35,059 --> 00:00:40,656
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Alder Tower. Rescue helicopter, landing
on the roof. Everyone lives. Even the parrot.

15
00:00:40,976 --> 00:00:45,593
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part two of two, the end
of The Last Floor. Follow for the next series.

